      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Embedding Provider**\n\nOkay, I'm setting the stage by creating `embed_batch.py` to handle batch text embedding. I've decided on Google Cloud's `vertexai` library, specifically its `TextEmbeddingModel`. This concrete choice ensures I have a defined external dependency to work with, making the code more manageable.\n\n\n**Establishing Batch Embedding**\n\nI'm solidifying the implementation plan by focusing on the `embed_batch.py` file. I'm now making it concrete; I'm importing Google Cloud's `vertexai` library, which provides the foundation I need. The `TextEmbeddingModel` is my specific target within this library, allowing me to generate the embeddings required for batch processing.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789868108842,
          "start": 1789868107947
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc73e8ab001w2hm29L0iK8n0L",
