      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Embedding Provider**\n\nI'm zeroing in on using Google Cloud's `vertexai.preview.language` as my embedding provider, and I'll make sure its identifier is clearly in the `embed_text.py` file. I'm focusing on incorporating this specific library in the code.\n\n\n**Implementing the Text Embedding**\n\nI've decided to proceed with implementing the `embed_text.py` file. I'm importing the necessary components, the `TextEmbeddingModel`, from Google Cloud's Vertex AI language models. I'll define an `embed_text` function to handle the embedding generation, initializing the text embedding model within it and using its `get_embeddings` method to derive the vector. I'm focusing on ensuring this function returns the extracted embedding vector.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789868105654,
          "start": 1789868104122
        },
